	['help.faqProfileText', 'Go to "Mine - Profile" and tap the item you want to change: username, avatar, signature, password or email.'],
	['help.faqFormatTitle', 'Which book formats are supported?'],
	['help.faqFormatText', 'TXT and PDF are currently supported. TXT can be imported on the app, the web and the WeChat mini program — the encoding (UTF-8 / GBK) is detected automatically, chapters are parsed, and the file name becomes the book title. PDF can only be imported on the app and is presented page by page from the original file; other formats are not supported yet.'],
	['help.faqSyncTitle', 'Will my books sync to the cloud?'],
	['help.faqSyncText', 'Once signed in, your book list and reading data (progress, underlines, thoughts and bookmarks) sync to the cloud automatically — just sign in with the same account on another device to restore them. Book files themselves are kept on the device only. Iron members or above can use "Cloud Sync" in the "+" menu on the bookshelf to back book files up to the cloud and keep devices in sync; when deleting a book, you can also choose to delete its cloud data at the same time.'],
	['delete.title', 'Account Deletion & Data'],
	['delete.desc', 'Learn how to delete your account and how related data is handled. This page is accessible without signing in.'],
	['delete.shareTitle', 'Account Deletion & Data'],
	['delete.s1Title', '1. How to Delete Your Account'],
	['delete.s1Text', 'You can request account deletion and remove all data by yourself inside the app:'],
	['delete.s1SubLabel', 'In the app:'],
	['delete.s1SubText', 'Open the app, go to "Mine - Profile" and tap "Delete Account" at the bottom.'],
	['delete.s1Btn', 'Sign in to delete'],
	['delete.s2Title', '2. 24-Hour Cooling-off Period'],
	['delete.s2Text', 'Once submitted, your account is frozen immediately and all login tokens are revoked. A 24-hour cooling-off period applies: you can sign in again during this period and withdraw the deletion request, restoring your account. After the period ends, your business data is deleted permanently and the account is marked "deleted" and cannot be signed in; you can still recover the account itself via "Forgot Password".'],
	['delete.s3Title', '3. Data Deleted & Account Recovery'],
	['delete.s3Text', 'After the cooling-off period, all business data linked to the account is deleted permanently. Only the master account record (username, email, password hash, signature, avatar key) is kept to support account recovery — you can restore the account and sign in again via "Forgot Password" email verification, but deleted business data will not be restored. We do not keep backup copies of deleted business data.'],
	['delete.s4Title', '4. Data Retained by Law'],
	['delete.s4Text', 'Where laws and regulations mandate a longer retention period, data beyond the deletion scope above will be deleted after the statutory period expires, with its use restricted by law in the meantime.'],
	['delete.s5Title', '5. Other Personal Information Rights'],
	['delete.s5Text', 'Besides account deletion, you have rights to access, copy, correct and supplement your personal information and to withdraw consent. To exercise these rights by email, write to xpg@wuzuniao.com; we will respond within 15 business days after verifying your identity. See the Privacy Policy and Terms of Service for details.'],
